            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.9.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 9.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.19.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kings 19.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " for forty days in the wilderness, tempted by the devil. And he ate nothing in those days; and when they were ended, he was hungry. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The devil said to him, “If you are the Son of God, command this stone to become bread.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 8.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And Jesus answered him, “It is written, ‘Man shall not live by bread alone.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the devil took him up, and showed him all the kingdoms of the world in a moment of time, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.5.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Jn 5.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and said to him, “To you I will give all this authority and their glory; for it has been delivered to me, and I give it to whom I will. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you, then, will worship me, it shall all be yours.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:8"
          },
